&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why?&lt;/strong&gt; Single source of truth, runtime values, autocomplete, easier refactoring.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Typescript</title><link>https://agentskill.wiki/skills/typescript/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://agentskill.wiki/skills/typescript/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="const-types-pattern-required"&gt;Const Types Pattern (REQUIRED)&lt;/h2&gt;
